*\page if IF...ELSE Statements
*
* Conditional statements are used to perform different actions based on different conditions.<BR>
*<span style='color:blue'><em><H4> Syntax: </H4></em></span>

* - Use if to specify a block of code to be executed, if a specified condition is true
* - Use else to specify a block of code to be executed, if the same condition is false
* <span style='color:blue'><em><B> <br>
Example:
</B> </em> </span><br>
*   get PA_4, myvar; 			&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  <span style='color:green'> rem read GPIO </span><br>
*   if(myvar==0) {\n
*	&nbsp;<span style='color:green'> rem if the GPIO is zero</span><br>
*	&nbsp;print " Result was Zero\n"};
*   else {
*	&nbsp;<span style='color:green'> rem if the GPIO is one</span><br>
*	&nbsp;print " Result was One\n"};
*	}
*
*/
